      "case_specific": true,
      "_comment": "Embassy-protocol micro-signals that operate orthogonally to the universal TELL. They register on the detective's eye as forms of cold-war diplomatic concealment: a language slip when surprised, a protocol break in the seating order, a hand at the signet ring, an over-careful French. Gated by convergence so the heavier tells only appear once the case has assembled.",
